ி வருவதால், நெற்றுகள் முற்றிய வாகை மரத்தின் உலர்ந்த காய்கள் ஒலிக்கும் மலைகளை உடைய அரிய பாலைநில வழி என்று கூறுவர், நம்முடைய மார்புகளுக்கு இடையே தங்குவதை வெறுத்து அவர் சென்ற வழியை.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her confidante after her lover has departed to earn wealth. She describes the harsh desert path (pālai) he has chosen to travel. She refers to him as 'the one who shunned the space between my breasts,' expressing her grief and feelings of abandonment. The desert is depicted with vivid imagery: the fierce, hot winds blow, causing the dry, mature pods of the uḻiñcil (siris) tree to rattle loudly. This auditory image of rattling dry pods in the scorching wind intensifies the loneliness and desolation of both the landscape and the heroine's heart.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,0.8],[0.8,1.77],[1.83,1.9],[1.9,3.5],[3.5,4.1],[4.1,4.5],[4.5,4.7],[4.7,6.4],[6.4,6.5],[6.5,7.3],[7.3,8.9],[8.9,9.4],[9.4,9.6],[9.6,10.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,0.9],[0.9,2.0],[2.1,2.2],[2.2,3.9],[3.9,4.4],[4.4,5.0],[5.0,5.2],[5.2,7.0],[7.0,7.2],[7.2,8.1],[8.1,9.7],[9.7,10.2],[10.2,10.4],[10.4,10.73]]},"sync":[[["வெந்திறல்","fierce strength"]],[["கடுவளி","harsh wind"]],[["பொங்கா","surging"],["போந்து","having come"]],[["போந்து","having come"],["என","as"]],[["நெற்று","dry pod"],["விளை","matured"]],[["உழிஞ்சில்","siris tree"]],[["வற்றல்","dried pods"]],[["ஆர்க்கும்","rattling"]],[["மலை","mountain"],["உடை","having"]],[["அருஞ்சுரம்","difficult desert path"]],[["என்ப","they say"],["நம்","our"]],[["முலை","breast"],["இடை","space between"]],[["முனிநர்","he who shunned"]],[["சென்ற","that went"]],[["ஆறு","path"]]]}